        "Description": "Good Afternoon, 47.\r\rThe agency was contracted to eliminate 5 individuals guilty of mass civillian killing,\rparticularly the massacre at the Charles University in Prague, 2006.\r\rYour first target is Trina Royce. \rRoyce is attending an event on the Burj Al-Ghazali, taking place in Dubai.\rRoyce is supposed to walk in public without any security, meaning you will be able to provide multiple opportunities to eliminate the target.\r\rHappy Hunting, 47.                    -Diana Burnwood",
